# Skill: summarize_timeline
name: summarize_timeline
description: Aggregate detections into a canonical, deterministic timeline summary.
step: summarize_timeline
destructive: false
inputs:
  video_uri: "URI of the source video"
  fps: "Frames per second to sample before inference"
prompt_example: >
  Give me a timeline summary of file:///data/flight.json: total detections, counts
  by class, and the time span covered.
